eshold" type="number" min="0" max="20" step="1" placeholder="3"></div></div><p class="settings-hint">名册角色被 AI 连续漏输出时，前 N 轮（默认 3）保留上轮的自由属性显示；超过 N 轮才替换为占位文案。名册保存在本聊天的变量中（随聊天导出）</p></div><div id="tab-content-theme" class="p-3.5 space-y-3" style="display:none"><div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-gray-700/10"><div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 block">主题风格</span> <span id="mms-theme-name" class="text-[10px] text-primary font-medium">当前：修仙风格</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 theme-dot-bar p-1 rounded-full border border-gray-700/20"><button class="theme-dot-btn" data-theme="romantic" title="修仙 (❤)" type="button"><i class="fa fa-heart"></i></button> <button class="theme-dot-btn" data-theme="day" title="白天 (☼)" type="button"><i class="fa fa-sun-o"></i></button> <button class="theme-dot-btn" data-theme="jade" title="血色 (🗡)" type="button"><i class="fa fa-leaf"></i></button> <button class="theme-dot-btn" data-theme="classic" title="古典 (📖)" type="button"><i class="fa fa-book"></i></button> <button class="theme-dot-btn" data-theme="night" title="黑夜 (🌙)" type="button"><i class="fa fa-moon-o"></i></button> <button class="theme-dot-btn" data-theme="fresh" title="清新 (🍃)" type="button"><i class="fa fa-envira"></i></button></div></div><div class="settings-group"><label class="settings-label">显示模式</label><div class="display-mode-options"><label class="display-mode-option"><input type="radio" name="display-mode" value="integrated" id="integrated-mode"> <span class="radio-custom"></span><div class="option-content"><span class="option-title">一体式美化</span> <span class="option-desc">显示完整的故事内容和状态信息</span></div></label> <label class="display-mode-option"><input type="radio" name="display-mode" value="status-only" id="status-only-mode" checked="checked"> <span class="radio-custom"></span><div class="option-content"><span class="option-title">美化状态栏</span> <span class="option-desc">仅显示状态信息，隐藏正文内容</span></div></label></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1"><div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 block">徽章折叠字符数</span> <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">单行累计字符超过该值即折叠</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><button id="foldchar-minus" class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-black/10 text-gray-300 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary/20" type="button" aria-label="减少字符数">−</button> <span id="foldchar-value" class="text-xs font-bold px-1.5 text-primary">40</span> <button id="foldchar-plus" class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-black/10 text-gray-300 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary/20" type="button" aria-label="增加字符数">+</button></div></div><p class="settings-hint">徽章按显示顺序累计字符数（含间隙），超过该值的部分折叠为"+N"，点开可展开/收起；数值越小折叠越早，越大越宽松（按你的字体与屏宽自行校准）</p><div class="settings-group"><label class="settings-label">行动选项点击处理</label><div class="action-mode-options"><label class="action-mode-option"><input type="radio" name="action-mode" value="send-to-chat" id="send-to-chat-mode" checked="checked"> <span class="radio-custom"></span><div class="option-content"><span class="option-title">发送到酒馆聊天框</span> <span class="option-desc">点击后将选项文本添加到聊天输入框中</span></div></label> <label class="action-mode-option"><input type="radio" name="action-mode" value="direct-execute" id="direct-execute-mode"> <span class="radio-custom"></span><div class="option-content"><span class="option-title">点击直接执行</span> <span class="option-desc">点击后立即发送消息并触发回复</span></div></label></div></div></div><div id="tab-content-ai" class="p-3.5 space-y-3" style="display:none"><div class="roster-surface px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/10 space-y-2.5"><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa fa-microchip text-primary"></i> 独立更新引擎 </span><span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-mono font-medium">● 状态同步</span></div><p class="text-[11px] 